  "title": "Authentic Mole Sauce",
  "description": "This authentic mole sauce recipe is richly flavored with hot chiles, spices, and rich chocolate. It&#39;s perfect for topping stewed meats or enchiladas.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-23T17:51:36-04:00",
